  src/ActorShapes.cpp and src/ActorShapes.h adapt the collision-shape helpers
  from src/Utils/ActorUtils.cpp and src/Utils/ActorUtils.h. Upstream contributors
  include Alan Tse, doodlum and Dawntic. NMN's adaptations, present in the
  September 21, 2026 public snapshot, rename and refactor these helpers.

  src/Hooks.cpp uses render-hook names and call-site references also present
  in Community Shaders src/Deferred.h and src/Features/TerrainBlending.h.
  src/Globals.h and src/Globals.cpp use the globals layout and runtime
  relocation references also present in Community Shaders' globals files.
  Credit to the Community Shaders contributors for these references.

  The Main_Update call-site/signature reference in src/Hooks.cpp was also
  verified against Community Shaders src/Hooks.cpp (dev, October 3, 2026).
  CPU gathering, collision caching and snapshot handoff are NMN implementations.

  tools/offline/fixtures/cs191_offset_vs.asm is compiled/disassembled from
  Community Shaders 1.9.1 Shaders/Utility.hlsl with its included headers,
  using VSHADER, RENDER_DEPTH and OFFSET_DEPTH. It is a GPLv3 regression fixture
  for the terrain-depth correction in src/TerrainDepthBias.h.

  These provenance notices were added September 28, 2026.

